---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Daley Organics"
  description="Daley Organics Terms of Service — governing your use of our website and related services."
  canonical="https://daleyorganics.com/terms"
>
  <div class="bg-[#141414] min-h-screen pt-[72px]">
    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="bg-[#0e0e0e] border-b border-white/10 py-14">
      <div class="container-custom">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-white/60">Effective date: January 2025</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="container-custom py-16 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="space-y-10 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">

        <p>These Terms of Service govern your use of the Daley Organics website and related services. By accessing or using the site, you agree to these terms.</p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By using this website, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">2. Products &amp; Services</h2>
          <p>Daley Organics provides soil mixes, compost, and organic amendments. Product descriptions are provided for informational purposes and may vary due to the natural variability of organic materials.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Availability may change based on seasonality and supplier inputs. We reserve the right to limit quantities or discontinue products.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">3. Orders &amp; Pricing</h2>
          <p>Prices are subject to change without notice. We strive for accuracy, but errors may occur. If we discover an error in pricing or availability, we may contact you to confirm or cancel the order.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">An order is not confirmed until we acknowledge it and/or schedule pickup or delivery. Payment terms may vary based on order size and delivery needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">4. Shipping &amp; Delivery</h2>
          <p>Local delivery availability depends on location, schedule, and load size. Delivery times are estimates and may change due to weather, road conditions, or operational constraints.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Pickup orders require scheduling. Customers are responsible for ensuring safe transport and appropriate vehicle/trailer capacity.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">5. Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
          <p>If you receive damaged or incorrect product, notify us promptly so we can evaluate and resolve the issue. Because soil and amendments are natural products, returns may be limited once opened, mixed, or applied.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">6. Product Use Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>Gardening and crop outcomes vary based on factors outside our control, including weather, watering, plant genetics, pests, and existing soil conditions. Product guidance is general and not a guarantee of results.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Daley Organics shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or revenues, arising out of or related to your use of the site or products.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">8. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Oregon, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised effective date. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">10. Contact</h2>
          <p>For questions about these Terms, please contact us via our <a href="/#contact" class="text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">Contact page</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
